173
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:28,280
Varasemad Corvette'i alustarbed.

174
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:28,280
olid tegelikult väga lähedal.

175
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:28,280
nendest.

176
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:34,400
Aga see on täiesti uus.

177
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:34,400
kõrgtehnoloogilise kleepematerjali abil.

178
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:34,400
