213
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:51,120
See on lihtsalt hea.

214
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:57,400
Tegelikult on see...

215
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:57,400
parim sportauto üldse.

216
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:57,400
...mis on pärit Ameerika Ühendriikidest.

217
00:07:57,440 --> 00:08:01,040
Ja seekord ei saa seda öelda.

218
00:07:57,440 --> 00:08:01,040
ja nüüd võiks sellele veel nalja lisada.

219
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:10,520
See on hea auto.

220
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:13,520
See on tüütav.

221
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:18,600
See on tüütu, sest...

222
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:18,600
teist korda.

223
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:18,600
selles sarjas.

224
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,720
Ma olen sinuga nõus...

225
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,720
Tegelikult, teisel korral.

226
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,720
Mul on selles sarjas teist korda teiega nõus.

227
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:24,400
Mis, sa ei kavatse?

228
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:24,400
