241
00:08:34,560 --> 00:08:37,160
Ah, sa aru, see on...

242
00:08:34,560 --> 00:08:37,160
see, see on tegelikult väga keeruline.

243
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,640
-kuna need mõlemad...

244
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,640
– See on tõepoolest väga hea sõita.

245
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,640
-Need on tõesti nii.

246
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:44,120
Noh, sellega pole midagi vaielda.

247
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:44,120
Aga ma ei tea, ma ei usu.

248
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:44,120
Porsche näeb väga hea välja.

249
00:08:44,160 --> 00:08:47,120
