2044
00:57:31,800 --> 00:57:32,840
(koputamine)

2045
00:57:37,720 --> 00:57:40,360
Üks tass teed.

2046
00:57:37,720 --> 00:57:40,360
Oh! Täitsa ideaalne.

2047
00:57:53,400 --> 00:57:55,400
- Kas James on see näinud?

2048
00:57:53,400 --> 00:57:55,400
-Mis?

2049
00:57:55,440 --> 00:57:57,200
Porru aitab vähki ennetada.

2050
00:57:55,440 --> 00:57:57,200
