2128
01:00:18,480 --> 01:00:22,440
Ja kes teab, mis.

2129
01:00:18,480 --> 01:00:22,440
keda see puudutab.

2130
01:00:22,480 --> 01:00:26,120
Arvestades Peugeot'i, see võib olla...

2131
01:00:22,480 --> 01:00:26,120
